    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brought to the market by PF Quirke & Co. is an impressive four-bedroom, two-bathroom detached bungalow, beautifully positioned in the scenic foothills of Slievenamon with breathtaking views overlooking Mullinahone. Constructed in the late 1970s, this substantial family home presents a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious countryside residence set on approximately 5Ha (12.25 acres) of mixed-use agricultural and native woodland, offering exceptional privacy and endless potential.\n\n\nThe accommodation extends to a generous kitchen/dining room, a comfortable living room, a separate sitting room opening into a bright conservatory, four well-proportioned bedrooms, a main family bathroom, and a guest WC. Outside are two former agricultural buildings, with good stonework, but in need of renovation.\n\n\nThe land is ideal for hobby farming, equestrian pursuits, recreational use, or simply enjoying the peace, space, and natural beauty of rural living.\n\n\nThis is a truly special property, combining tranquillity, character, and spectacular scenery, while remaining within easy reach of Mullinahone and its local amenities, Kilkenny and Clonmel.\n\n\nHaving been vacant for over two years, the property now offers its next owner the opportunity to restore it to its former glory. Subject to eligibility, it may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, making it an even more attractive prospect.\n\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\nWe showcase our properties first on pfq.ie, Facebook, and Instagram before they are released to wider portals.\nRegister for alerts on pfq.ie or follow us online to be the first to know.\"\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 2.12m (6'11\") x 10.81m (35'6\")\n\nLiving Room - 3.95m (13'0\") x 3.93m (12'11\")\nCarpet, open fire,\n\nSitting Room - 4.25m (13'11\") x 4.54m (14'11\")\nOpen fire\n\nKitchen/ Dining room - 6.07m (19'11\") x 3.17m (10'5\")\nTiled floor, mahogany cabinetry, hotpress\n\nConservatory - 2.33m (7'8\") x 2.87m (9'5\")\n\nBedroom - 3.95m (13'0\") x 3.93m (12'11\")\n\nBedroom - 3.61m (11'10\") x 3.94m (12'11\")\nBuilt in mahogany wardrobes\n\nBedroom - 3.62m (11'11\") x 3.74m (12'3\")\nBuilt in mahogany wardrobes\n\nBedroom - 3.15m (10'4\") x 3.86m (12'8\")\n\nBathroom - 2.11m (6'11\") x 3.15m (10'4\")\nWC, WHB, bath, shower\n\nRear Hall - 1.5m (4'11\") x 1.16m (3'10\")\nTile floor\n\nGuest Bathroom - 1.85m (6'1\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\nTiled floor, WC, WHB\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
